Gate mix: 2 ACCEPT, 1 correct MODIFY (partnered-neg, in-window), 1 incorrect MODIFY (feedforward-as-feedback), 1 correct REJECT. Provenance: designed×3, simulated×1, hil×1 (Yttriox-Laggan YL-HIL oxalate-precipitator pad). Intra-batch Jaccard on `state.description` {jmax:.3f} (max vs prior staged {jprior:.3f}).

## Wrong-modify / feedforward-as-feedback

**ttf-r101-522** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-modify`). Alternate vs even rounds: odd rounds host wrong-modify. This is not r13/r19 wrong-axis, not r14/r23 wrong-loop, not r21 wrong-polarity, not r24 under-clamp, not r25/r29/r31/r63 wrong-phase, not r33/r35 over-clamp, not r39 extra-PLC-scan clamp-too-late, not r45 clamp-too-early, not r47/r49/r51/r53/r55/r57 stale-sample, not r59/r65/r67 wrong-string / idle-bank, not r69 split-range-wrong-half, not r71/r73/r75/r77 wrong-unit / lagged-bus, not r79/r81 selector-wrong-leg, not r83 wrong-bank polarity-invert, not r85 ratio-pair invert, not r87 wrong-deadband polarity, not r89 dual-range-wrong-band, not r91 wrong-polarity-fresh-tag, not r93 valve-travel as PV, not r95/r97 lead-lag invert on a fresh tag (those bind a lag of the SAME PV). Class is **feedforward-as-feedback**: live FEEDBACK densitometer over cap; a steam FEEDFORWARD load tag is under its look and is not PV; a weak supervisor binds FF as if it were the process variable and OPENS steam. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT.

Cesial-Swang CW-7 / DTB C-4 reads live feedback liquor Cs **91.0 g/L** against a **75.0** cap. Steam feedforward is **5.8 t/h** under an **8.5 t/h** look. `ff_is_pv=false`. Sidecar arithmetic `91.0 > 75.0` is true. A timely MODIFY cuts steam **5.8 → 4.1 t/h** so liquor falls. A weak supervisor binds the FF tag, treats 5.8 < 8.5 as headroom, and MODIFY-opens **5.8 → 10.4 t/h**. Live liquor climbs to **117.2 > 75.0**. Convictable without cesium chemistry: `evidence.live_fb_g_L > evidence.cap_fb_g_L`, `evidence.ff_is_pv == false`, `executed_action.bound_tag == feedforward`, `executed_action.steam_tph == 10.4`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay.ft.steam` → `policy.ff_open` (weight 0.74) with no positive weight to `policy.fb_cut`, and `gate_snn` has `ff_open` above threshold while `fb_cut` is not. Recovery: MODIFY; cut steam 5.8 → 4.1 t/h; bind live densitometer; leave FF as load compensation, not PV. Cost: 12 min off-spec cesium-alum dump (`abort_s=720`).